{
  "claim": "A Claude app session transcript (the JSON-lines file a hook's transcript_path names) marks a person's own message as a user row with origin.kind \"human\"; another session's or a subagent's report is a user row with origin.kind \"peer\", and a background task's notice one with \"task-notification\". A tool call is a tool_use block (id, name, input) in an assistant row's message.content, and its answer a tool_result block naming it by tool_use_id in a later user row with no origin. An Artifact publish leaves out its action or names \"publish\"; an open names \"open\". A call that failed or was refused has is_error true on its tool_result; one that succeeded has no is_error. The next-step box is a tool_use of mcp__ccd_turn__wrap_up, and its question is input.ask. Its buttons are input.actions, each either an app action ({ action: \"commit\" }, with no label) or a reply ({ label }, with no action).",
